From 5684a2e2d77410e52f6bdde598d69b02105b7172 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timothy Schmidt <timschmidt@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:22:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: power: Describe MSM8226 system sleep
 coordination

Describe the RPM child that coordinates CPR, CPU/L2 SAW and MPM during
MSM8226 system sleep. Restrict that child to the MSM8226 resource service
and describe the MPM interrupt controller's zero address-cell form. Route
the new binding through the existing Qualcomm architecture maintainers.

The full processed schema validates all 21 candidate DTBs silently. Twelve
malformed binding controls are rejected. The 20 prior DTBs are byte-identical.
This describes a local experimental interface pending cross-subsystem review.

Codex generated this source, host tests and draft message during the Fx0
bringup. Human review and DCO remain pending. This feature is local and
has not been submitted; it has no Fixes tag.
---
 .../interrupt-controller/qcom,mpm.yaml        |  3 ++
 .../power/qcom,msm8226-system-pm.yaml         | 45 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../bindings/soc/qcom/qcom,smd-rpm.yaml       | 16 +++++++
 MAINTAINERS                                   |  1 +
 4 files changed, 65 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/qcom,msm8226-system-pm.yaml

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/interrupt-controller/qcom,mpm.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/interrupt-controller/qcom,mpm.yaml
index ebb40c48950a..1efb3dceb057 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/interrupt-controller/qcom,mpm.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/interrupt-controller/qcom,mpm.yaml
@@ -48,6 +48,9 @@ properties:
 
   interrupt-controller: true
 
+  '#address-cells':
+    const: 0
+
